  "ruleText": "Plc 1809.02 Procedures for Disciplinary and Non-Disciplinary Remedial Proceedings and Imposing Certification Conditions. The procedures in Plc 311 shall govern disciplinary and non-disciplinary remedial proceedings and imposing certification conditions.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
